    "confidence": 0.9,
    "explanation": "To the rider: your delayed flight and your position in the terminal do not decide this charge. POL-NS-01 asks only whether the driver completed four steps, and on this bundle he did all four. He recorded an 'arrived' event at 23:13:10 (EV-TRIP-00202); the GPS trace (EV-GPS-00202) places him inside the 150 m Changi T3 arrival radius from 23:12:45, before that event, so the POL-NS-02 proximity test is met; he then held a single unbroken in-geofence run of 620 seconds, 23:12:45 to 23:23:05, against the 480-second AIRPORT minimum, a surplus of 140 seconds; and he cancelled at 23:23:20 with reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW, after the minimum had elapsed and with no boarding event (started_at and ended_at null). No refund route displaces the fee. POL-NS-03 does not apply: his closest approach to the pin was 22.4 m, inside the arrival radius, so there is no wrong-entrance case and no pin-ambiguity goodwill. POL-NS-04 does not apply because it requires a locating or coordinating message from you during the waiting window, and the chat log contains none from you. POL-NS-05 is not engaged: at the arrival tap he was stationary inside the geofence, not more than 300 m away and not travelling at 15 km/h or above. POL-NS-06 gives you nothing because there is no shortfall. I accept, as EV-CHAT-00202 shows (impaired, weight 0.85, issue UNREAD_MESSAGE, read_at null on every message), that you did not see the driver's two messages, but no limb of POL-NS-01 turns on that.\n\nTo the driver: the SGD 6.00 AIRPORT cancellation fee stands. It is the greater of the SGD 6.00 zone-class fee and the SGD 4.00 RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee, produced on the zone-class dimension, and it reconciles with the fare-breakdown cancellation-fee line (EV-FARE-00202), so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect. Under POL-NS-07 you are compensated SGD 4.80, being 80 percent of the SGD 6.00 fee, with the residual 20 percent retained as the platform service fee. The anti-farming check passes on both limbs: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the 4 the clause requires, and 1 divided by 168 completed trips is 0.006, far below the 0.08 rate, so compensation is paid rather than withheld. Your profile snapshot EV-DPROF-00202 is impaired (weight 0.9, issue SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH); the two counters it carries sit an order of magnitude below their thresholds, so the finding survives the discount. It is the lowest-weighted artifact bearing on the outcome, and it sets confidence at 0.9.\n\nOn the rider's submission that her presence at the pickup is undecidable: I accept that all 88 rider fixes report 45 m to 80 m horizontal accuracy and are filtered out by the 25 m test, so POL-NS-04 limb (c) cannot be run and is neutral rather than failed, exactly as that clause and POL-NS-08(b) provide. That does not change the result. POL-NS-04 requires all three limbs, and limb (a) fails outright because no rider message was sent, so the clause cannot apply in either direction; and no limb of POL-NS-01 reads rider position. Rider presence is therefore not a deciding fact, and POL-NS-09(e) is not engaged. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires at all: the deciding facts are carried by EV-GPS-00202, EV-TRIP-00202 and EV-FARE-00202 at weight 1.0; there is no direct contradiction between admissible artifacts on arrival, dwell or rider presence (POL-NS-04 resolves the rider track to neutral); both disputes_with_counterparty_90d counters are 0; no_show_disputes_30d is 1, below the 3 that limb (d) reads; and the anti-farming check does not trip. The traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00202-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0), which makes POL-NS-06 limb (i) accumulation unavailable, but no accumulation is needed here. No clause produces a referral, so the referrals list is empty."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}

