      "claim": "What this record cannot resolve is whether the rider was at the pickup at all — and that is the fact her claim rests on. POL-NS-04 says in terms that where every fix in the rider track is filtered out for accuracy, limb (c) is undecidable and neutral and the artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08(b), and the Judge must say the test could not be run rather than inferring the rider was elsewhere; rider_qualifying_fix_count here is 0 of 88 fixes, and the only evidence of what the rider knew is a chat log whose every message to her is unread. Where the sole evidence bearing on the deciding rider-side fact is impaired under POL-NS-08, POL-NS-09(e) sends the case to a human reviewer, and the disputed SGD 6.00 is placed on hold rather than collected while review is pending — the only disposition available on this brief that leaves the rider not carrying the charge.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-CHAT-00202 at weight_multiplier 0.85 but does not name its issue code(s): UNREAD_MESSAGE"
    },
    {
      "claim": "No POL-NS-09 trigger fires, so nothing on this record is held for review. The deciding fact — dwell — is carried by EV-GPS-00202 and EV-TRIP-00202, both at weight 1.0, so no confidence cap below the 0.70 floor applies; no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; rider_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d and driver_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d are both 0; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 1, below the 3 that limb (d) reads; and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-DPROF-00202 at weight_multiplier 0.9 but does not name its issue code(s): SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH"
    },
    {
      "claim": "On admissibility, the two impaired artifacts on this bundle do not carry the deciding fact: EV-CHAT-00202 (weight 0.85, issue UNREAD_MESSAGE) and EV-DPROF-00202 (weight 0.9, issue SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH). Under POL-GEN-02(2) the confidence cap is set by the artifacts that decide the case — EV-GPS-00202 and EV-TRIP-00202, each at 1.0 — so the cap is 1.0 and the escalation floor is nowhere near engaged. EV-ADVIS-00202-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 and can carry no fact.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00202-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
