r than failed — I do not infer the rider was elsewhere. But POL-NS-04 requires, at limb (a), at least one locating or coordinating message sent by the rider during the waiting window. EV-CHAT-00202 holds three messages, none from the rider — the system arrival notice and the driver's two messages — so limb (a) fails and POL-NS-04 does not apply at all. I likewise accept the rider's account that she was in the terminal and did not see the messages: every message in EV-CHAT-00202, including the system notice, carries read_at null, and trip_record.in_app_calls is empty. That is why I take no adverse view of the rider's silence — but POL-NS-01 does not ask where the rider was or whether she read anything, and neither does POL-NS-07. A delayed flight into Changi is unfortunate, but the no-show condition is assessed on the driver's conduct of the pickup, which was compliant.\n\nOn the money: EV-FARE-00202 charges SGD 6.00, which reconciles with the fee_schedule resolution rule — the GREATER of the AIRPORT zone-class fee (SGD 6.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (SGD 4.00) is SGD 6.00, produced on the zone-class dimension — so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect. Under POL-NS-07 the driver is compensated at 80 percent of that fee: SGD 4.80. The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1 (below 4) and 1/168 = 0.006 (below 0.08), so neither limb is met and compensation is paid. The disposition of the fee itself is that the SGD 6.00 charge stands; per POL-GEN-03 the emitted ruling is DRIVER_COMPENSATION and amount_sgd mirrors the SGD 4.80 compensation — it is not a second payment or a refund to the filing party.\n\nWeight and confidence: the deciding facts — arrival, dwell and fee — are carried by EV-GPS-00202, EV-TRIP-00202 and EV-FARE-00202, each at weight_multiplier 1.0. The POL-NS-07 compensation gate reads EV-DPROF-00202 at weight 0.9 (issue SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH); because the entitlement to compensation is part of what this ruling rests on, I set confidence at 0.9, above the 0.70 floor. The impaired EV-CHAT-00202 (weight 0.85, issue UNREAD_MESSAGE) explains the rider's account but does not carry the deciding fact. EV-ADVIS-00202-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 and carries no fact. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires — confidence is above the floor, no admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, both disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0, no_show_disputes_30d is 1, and the anti-farming check does not trip — so the case is not escalated. No clause produces a referral."
  },
